# github's linguist ranks languages by BYTES, and a notebook is mostly base64
# plot images rather than code. this repo carries 242 MB of notebooks and 63 MB
# of exported html against 0.8 MB of python, so it reported as 79% "Jupyter
# Notebook" and 21% "HTML" while the thing it ships is a python package -
# 4.5k lines in src/omicstra, 13k in scripts, 1.2k in tests.
#
# none of the html here is source: it is exported notebooks, generated reports
# and a slide deck. the first pass at this scoped the html rule to docs/ and
# missed notebooks/final/05_summary_umaps_v3.html, which is 61.7 MB on its own -
# so the rules below are deliberately unscoped.
#
# this changes the language bar and diff rendering only. nothing is hidden,
# ignored, or excluded from the repository.

*.ipynb                 linguist-documentation

# generated or exported output. `generated` also collapses their diffs, which
# matters when a single file is 60 MB.
*.html                  linguist-generated
docs/reports/**         linguist-generated